# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for clogx.
#
# Entries are added ONLY for races involving external uninstrumented code
# (e.g. system libyaml) that cannot be instrumented in CI, plus benign-by-design
# lock-free protocols (seqlock) whose correctness TSan cannot verify — those must
# cite the guard mechanism. Do NOT add entries for other races inside clogx itself.

# macOS Apple Clang TSan interposer quirk in test_multithread_sync
race:file_write
# Benign by design: module[] seqlock payload. The writer's snprintf races the
# reader's optimistic memcpy, but every torn copy is detected by the module_gen
# double-flip and re-read under module_mutex. Guard: module_gen in core/log.c.
race:logger_set_module_internal